          "expect": "The host registers exactly these runtime codes defined by the core, each with the core/ prefix and none without it: core/NumericOverflow, core/DivideByZero, core/Domain, core/NonFinite, core/OutOfRange, core/Parse, core/IndexOutOfBounds, core/NoneValue, core/UnknownVariant, core/UninitializedVariable, core/LoopBudgetExceeded, core/LimitExceeded, core/QueueOverflow, core/RunawayEventChain, core/RunStopping, core/Cancelled, core/Timeout, core/OutcomeUnknown, core/StaleHandle, core/CapabilityUnavailable, core/InternalFault. Package codes keep their own namespace (for example org.orange.test/Boom)."
